    text: "Affected northbound trips:\r\n5:31 am from Evans Station\r\n7:04 am from I-25 & Broadway Station\r\n8:34 am from I-25 & Broadway Station\r\n10:04 am from I-25 & Broadway Station\r\n11:34 am from I-25 & Broadway Station\r\n1:04 pm from I-25 & Broadway Station\r\n\nAffected southbound trips:\r\n6:16 am from 30th & Downing Station\r\n7:46 am from 30th & Downing Station\r\n9:16 am from 30th & Downing Station\r\n10:46 am from 30th & Downing Station\r\n12:16 pm from 30th & Downing Station\r\n1:46 pm from 30th & Downing Station"
